# Requirements (hypotheses)

### H1: Lag 200 deg or an added c4 raises x above 0.266 m at 2.1 Hz

WHEN c2 and c3 carry sines at 2.1 Hz with c3 lagging c2 by 200 deg and c0, c1, c4 are 0, THE system SHALL reach x of at least 0.27 m.

```prediction
# relies on: R8, R7, R5
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "x"
range = [0.2, 0.5]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
f = 2.1
phi = 200
a4 = 0
phi4 = 0
```

Notes: Three variants in one compare: lag 200 with no c4; lag 225 with c4 in phase with c2; lag 225 with c4 lagging c2 by 90 deg.

Result (E1): lag 200 gave x = 0.294 m, y = 0.113 m, heading +10.6 deg. c4 variants were worse (x = 0.100 with heading +72 deg; x = 0.207).

